# Build outputs
app/*/bin/
app/*/obj/
build/publish/
build/installer/bin/
build/installer/obj/
build/installer/payload.zip

# Installer artifact — keep Filio-Setup-<version>.exe available locally at the repo root
# (that's the GitHub Release deliverable, uploaded via `gh release create`), but never
# commit it to git — it's a large generated binary, not source.
/Filio-Setup-*.exe

# ...and ignore the copy in build/ too, which is a build artifact
build/Filio-Setup-*.exe

# Local Claude Code tool state (lock files etc.) — not meaningful project config
.claude/

# User-specific VS files
*.user
.vs/

# dotnet
*.suo

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
SPEC.md
CHANGELOG.md
PROJECT.md
RELEASE-CHECKLIST.md
DELETIONS.md
